  "job_B19.1_20251003_114440": {
    "text": "DE25A1 On \u00feone forman d\u00e6ig on geare, \u00fe\u00e6t is on \u00feone \u00e6restan geoheld\u00e6ig, eall cristen folc wor\u00feia\u00f0\nDE25A3 Sancta Maria hine acende on \u00fe\u00e6re nihte on anum holum stanscr\u00e6fe beforan Bethem \u00f0\u00e6re\nDE25A8 And him s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t eallra folca h\u00e6lend w\u00e6re acenned, ond \u00f0a hirdas gehirdon micelne engla\nDE25A10 \u00dea w\u00e6s agangen fram middangeardes fruman fif \u00feusend geare ond ane geare l\u00e6s \u00feonne twa\nDE25A13 On \u00feam geare \u00fea he w\u00e6s acenned \u00fea \u00e6teowdon swilc tacn mannum swilce \u00e6r n\u00e6ron ne\nDE25A16 \u00dey geare men gesawon III sunnan, ond o\u00fere si\u00f0e III monan.\nDE25A17 Ond Romanan gesawon firen cleowen feallan of heofnum, ond o\u00fere si\u00fee gilden cleowen.\nDE25A19 Ond \u00fei geare man geseah hw\u00e6tes eare weaxan on treowum.\nDE25A20 Ond on sumere m\u00e6ig\u00f0e \u00feonne hi hira hlaf br\u00e6con \u00e6t mete, \u00feonne fleow \u00fe\u00e6t blod of \u00feam\nDE25A23 Ond \u00fei geare man geseah meoloc rinan of heofnum ond lamb sp\u00e6can on mennisc gecinde\nDE25A25 Ond he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Tohwon sticast \u00feu me?\nDE25A27 God hw\u00e6te geweaxe\u00f0 togeare.\nDE25A29 Ac ne bist \u00f0u \u00feonne, ne his ne abitest.\nDE25A30 Eall \u00feis tacnode \u00fe\u00e6t seo cl\u00e6ne f\u00e6mne cende sunu, swa hire n\u00e6fre wer ne gehran, ac se \u00f0e\nDE25A34 \u00de\u00e6t b\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t sancta Maria \u00fe\u00e6t cild on ba\u00feode \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t manige untrume men \u00fe\u00e6r on\nDE25B1 On \u00feone ilcan d\u00e6ig Cristes acennednesse godes circean arwor\u00f0ia\u00f0 sancta Anastasiam gebird\nDE25B4 Diocletianus se h\u00e6\u00feena casere hi sealde his gereuas \u00fe\u00e6t hi sceolde mid witum bregean, \u00fe\u00e6t\nDE25B7 \u00dea het se gerefa hi belucan in carcerne sixtig daga ond nihta, ond hire man ne sealde ne hlaf\nDE25B10 Hire com \u00e6lce niht sumes haliges wifes gast to, seo w\u00e6s haten sancta Theodote, ond broht\nDE25B15 \u00d0a \u00e6fter syxtigum dagum, \u00fea heo ut eode of \u00feam carcerne, \u00fea w\u00e6s hire ansin swa reod ond\nDE25B18 \u00deurh wuldorlicne martyrdom heo forlet \u00feis andwearde lif, ond hire lichama reste\u00f0 nu on\nDE25C1 On \u00f0one forman d\u00e6ig bi\u00f0 sancta Eufemian tid \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6\u00feelan f\u00e6mnan.\nDE25C2 Seo w\u00e6s on Commodes dagon \u00fe\u00e6s caseres, ond heo lufode Crist, \u00e6r heo gefullod w\u00e6re.\nDE25C4 Heo w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e m\u00e6res weres dohtur, se w\u00e6s haten Philippus.\nDE25C5 He was \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6ran burge gereua \u00fee hatte Alexandria, ond ealle Egipta \u00feeode him hirdon.\nDE25C7 \u00dea \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den w\u00e6s XV gear, \u00fea wolde se f\u00e6der hi sellan sumum \u00e6\u00feelon men to bryde.\nDE25C9 \u00dea on niht bescear heo hire feax swa weras ond onfeng weres gegyrlan ond gewat of hire\nDE25C11 \u00dea eode heo on wera minster, \u00feer nan wifman \u00e6r ne com, ond heo onfeng fulwihte ond gode\nDE25C15 Ond binnan III gearum heo wear\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s minstres abbud.\nDE25C16 Ond heo was swa mihtegu wi\u00f0 god \u00fe\u00e6t heo sealde blindum men gesih\u00f0e ond deofulseoce\nDE25C19 Ond \u00fea \u00e6fter manegum gearum heo w\u00e6s fram hire f\u00e6der ongitenu ond bro\u00ferum, ond si\u00f0\u00f0an\nDE25C21 \u00de\u00e6r Necittius, Romeburge gereua, hi nidde \u00fe\u00e6t heo Criste wi\u00f0soce ond deofulgild gelifde.\nDE25C23 \u00dea heo \u00fe\u00e6t nolde, \u00fea het he bindan hire stan to \u00feam swuran ond worpan on Tifre flod.\nDE25C25 \u00dea tob\u00e6rs se stan, ond heo fleat ofer \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ter to lande.\nDE25C27 Ond \u00fea het he hi eft sendan on birnendne ofon, ond se acolode sona.\nDE25C29 \u00dea het hie don on carcern, ond heo w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r X niht and dagas butan mete.\nDE25C30 \u00dea \u00e6teowde hire drihten silfa on \u00fea ilcan niht \u00e6t his acennisse ond cw\u00e6\u00f0 to hire.\nDE25C32 Ic \u00fee nime Eugenie, ond ic eom se \u00fee \u00feu lufodest.\nDE25C35 \u00dei illcan d\u00e6ge ic to heofnum astah \u00fee \u00fee ic to eor\u00fean com.\nDE25C36 Ond \u00fei ilcan d\u00e6ig heo onsende hire gast to gode, ond hire lichama reste\u00f0 wi\u00f0 Romebirig on\nDE26A1 On \u00feone \u00e6fteran d\u00e6ig godes circean arwor\u00f0ia\u00f0 sanctus Stefanus gemind \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6restan\nDE26A4 \u00deone halgan Stefanus Cristes \u00feegnas gehalgodon to diacone, ac Iudeas hine eft mi\u00f0 stanum\nDE26A8 Ond \u00fea hi Stefanus to \u00fe\u00e6re st\u00e6ninge l\u00e6ddon, \u00fea mihte he locian on heofnas, ond he geseah\nDE26A11 Ond he hit \u00feam Iudeum s\u00e6de, ond hi him micle \u00fee re\u00f0ran on w\u00e6ron ond \u00fee ra\u00feor hine\nDE26A13 \u00dea leton hi his lichaman licgan butan Hierusalem \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre, ond woldon \u00fe\u00e6t hine fuglas\nDE26A17 \u00dea bebirigde hine sum geleafful man, se w\u00e6s haten Gamaliel.\nDE26A20 Ond \u00fea \u00e6fter manegum gearum w\u00e6s se lichama geci\u00f0ed \u00feurh heofonlicu tacn, ond \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s\nDE26A21 \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s sanctus Stefnanus wundra sum \u00fe\u00e6t an plegende cild arn under w\u00e6nes hweowol\nDE26A23 \u00dea nam \u00fe\u00e6s cild modor \u00feone deadan lichaman ond wearp on sanctus Stefanus circean \u00fe\u00e6r\nDE26A26 \u00dea heo eft com, \u00fea mitte heo hire cild lifiende ond gesund.\nDE27A1 On \u00feone III d\u00e6ig bi\u00f0 Sancte Iohannes tid \u00fe\u00e6s godspellres, se w\u00e6s Criste leof ofer ealle o\u00fere\nDE27A3 Ond II beorgas litelra stana he gesenode to \u00e6\u00feelum gymmum.\nDE27A5 And rice h\u00e6\u00feene men hine snidon \u00fe\u00e6t he dranc ator, on \u00feam was \u00e6lces cynnes wirm o\u00f0\u00f0e\nDE27A8 Ond his birgen is mid Grecum on Effessio \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre.\nDE27A10 \u00c6t \u00fe\u00e6re gyrgine bi\u00f0 wellmicel wundor gesewen ond gehired.\nDE27A12 Hwilon heo e\u00f0a\u00f0 swa lifiende man slape, hwilon \u00feonne man \u00fea byrgine sceawa\u00f0, \u00feonne ne\nDE27A18 For\u00feam nat n\u00e6nig man hw\u00e6\u00feer se Johannes si \u00fee cwicu \u00fee dead.\nDE28A1 On \u00feone feor\u00fean d\u00e6ig bi\u00f0 \u00feara haligra cilda tid \u00fee Herodes acwealde for Criste on\nDE28A6 Herodes het tion \u00f0a cild of hira modor breostum ond bosmum, ond \u00feonne man \u00fea cild\nDE28A9 \u00dea w\u00e6ron \u00fea cild mid hira blode gefullode ond \u00fea modor mid \u00feam tearum gefullode for \u00feam\nDE28A11 \u00de\u00e6ra cildea w\u00e6s tu CC and XI and IIII mille.\nDE28A12 Ond Erodes forwear\u00f0 \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6ra cilda cweallme, ond he ofstang hine silfne mid his agenre\nDE31A1 On \u00feone VII d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00fees bi\u00f0 sancte Siluestres tid \u00fe\u00e6s halgan papan, \u00fe\u00e6s lichoma\nDE31A3 Se dide fela wundra \u00e6r he papa w\u00e6re.\nDE31A4 Tarquinius hatte Romeburge gereua.\nDE31A5 He \u00fereatode hine to h\u00e6\u00feenscipe.\nDE31A5 \u00dea nolde he \u00fe\u00e6t.\nDE31A6 \u00dea het hine man gebindan ond l\u00e6dan to carcerne.\nDE31A8 \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 sanctus Silluester to him, Disega, on \u00feisse nihte \u00fee bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t feorh afirred.\nDE31A9 And \u00fe\u00e6t gelamp.",
